  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_98145a3f-ec07-44f1-9527-b6dab999f99d.png\">&nbsp; 为太阳带来全新面貌，优化天空！&nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_98145a3f-ec07-44f1-9527-b6dab999f99d.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">更改了太阳纹理！它不再是方块了！它是一团带有光线的大型光球！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">支持所有版本！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6308ce3a-ca14-4000-a267-3b9c2498f357.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_54d1723a-e523-45d8-8bf6-1949a94ef906.png\"></p>",
